ss=\"search-bar\"><label for=\"search\" style=\"position:absolute;left:-9999px;\">Search help articles</label><input type=\"search\" id=\"search\" placeholder=\"Search for answers...\"><button type=\"button\">Search</button></div></section><section class=\"categories\" aria-label=\"Help categories\"><div class=\"category-card\"><h3>Getting Started</h3><p>Set up your account and start using our software.</p><a href=\"#\">Browse articles</a></div><div class=\"category-card\"><h3>Account &amp; Billing</h3><p>Manage your subscription, invoices, and payment methods.</p><a href=\"#\">Browse articles</a></div><div class=\"category-card\"><h3>Troubleshooting</h3><p>Resolve common issues and error messages.</p><a href=\"#\">Browse articles</a></div><div class=\"category-card\"><h3>API &amp; Integration</h3><p>Connect our software with your tools and workflows.</p><a href=\"#\">Browse articles</a></div></section><section class=\"popular\"><h2>Popular Articles</h2><ul><li><a href=\"#\">How to reset your password</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">Setting up two-factor authentication</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">Integrating with Slack</a></li><li><a href=\"#\">Understanding your invoice</a></li></ul></section><footer class=\"footer\"><p>© 2025 Acme Software. All rights reserved.</p></footer></main></body></html>", "mode": "fill"}, {"id": "ab_ca7c5e8d98364e09", "name": "Article", "width": 1440.0, "height": 900.0, "background": "#FFFFFF", "nodeIds": [], "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><title>Article</title><style>/* @tweak accent color \"Accent color\" */ --tw-accent: #0F766E; /* @tweak density choice \"Density\" \"compact\" \"comfortable\" */ --tw-density: comfortable; body { margin: 0; font-family: var(--ds-font-body-family); color: var(--ds-color-text); background: var(--ds-color-background); } .app { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-height: 100vh; } .header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: var